	<section_number>6.2-1304</section_number>
	<catch_line>Franchise tax exemption</catch_line>
	<text>
		All credit unions organized under the laws of the Commonwealth and doing business purely as credit unions shall be exempt from the payment of any franchise tax.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 6-233; 1966, c. 584, § 6.1-225; 1990, c. 373, § 6.1-225.63; 2010, c. 794.</history>
